    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless subway platform. Observe your surroundings carefully and escape this nightmare. This is all a lie...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues, solve puzzles, and escape this nightmare. Sounds are an important part of the experience, so put on your headphones and listen carefully. There are no traditional weapons in this game, but you must strategically eliminate certain enemies to progress. Think creatively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814580/extras/82866fd959bf77c531029abb96cd1194.poster.avif?t=1754659717\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814580/extras/82866fd959bf77c531029abb96cd1194.webm?t=1754659717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814580/extras/82866fd959bf77c531029abb96cd1194.mp4?t=1754659717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subway Exit is a short walking simulator inspired by the long, repetitive corridors of subways, the unsettling atmosphere of liminal spaces, and the mysterious concept of backrooms. In this game, death is permanent. After death, you will restart from Platform 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814580/extras/cc06903b03da44aa397e4cfe0269da4a.poster.avif?t=1754659717\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814580/extras/cc06903b03da44aa397e4cfe0269da4a.webm?t=1754659717\" 